2026-07-27T08:46:43.2818085Z i /tmp/RtmpHwBSOL/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:46:43.2818409Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:46:43.2818790Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:46:43.2819517Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:46:43.2820056Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:46:43.2821177Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:46:43.2821696Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
